@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam roundCorner 14

start
:Frame of identifier ID
(timestamp, up to 8 payload bytes);
:Add it to the window of ID
(last 10 frames of this identifier);
if (at least 11 frames
of ID so far?) then (yes)
  fork
    :Timing features
    ----
    time_diff
    rolling mean of time_diff
    rolling std of time_diff;
  fork again
    :Payload features
    ----
    byte_diff
    rolling mean, std and max of byte_diff
    changed_bytes_count
    payload_entropy;
  end fork
  :Keep only the features that vary
  for ID in the training data;
  :Vector of up to 9 values
  for the model of ID;
else (no)
  :Warmup: no features,
  the frame is not scored;
endif
stop
@enduml
